  "notes": "- Lists one directory: the subdirectories directly in `path`, across every page the connector returns. Files are listed with Storage.File.List.\n- Omit `path` to list the root of the connection, which is its base path.\n- Paths are relative to the base path of the connection and use forward slashes. Outer slashes are ignored. A path with a \".\" or \"..\" segment, a backslash, an empty inner segment or a control character is refused, and the full path (base path and path) may not exceed 2048 characters."
